%%{init: {"sequence": {"mirrorActors": false, "wrap": true}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    participant DB as SQLite meridian.db
    participant Orch as forecast orchestrator
    participant Model as cropmod
    participant Parser as parser
    participant Store as Store
    participant API as Java API
    participant Browser as browser

    DB-->>Orch: station-year keys<br/>SQLite rows
    DB-->>Orch: weather readings<br/>doy, tmax, tmin, rain, srad
    Orch->>Model: MERIDIAN.DAT<br/>fixed-width text in scratch dir
    Model-->>Parser: MERIDIAN.OUT<br/>fixed-width text
    Parser->>Store: ForecastResult<br/>Python object
    Store->>DB: forecast + forecast_daily<br/>SQL rows in one transaction
    Browser->>API: HTTP GET<br/>/api/forecast
    API->>DB: SQL via SQLite JDBC<br/>in-process forecast query
    DB-->>API: JDBC ResultSet<br/>query rows
    API->>API: Db converts rows to JSON
    API-->>Browser: HTTP JSON body<br/>forecast rows
    Browser->>Browser: JS forecast data<br/>Yield (t/ha)
